<title>UK: Shell interim dividend 14.4 pence.</title>
<headline>Shell interim dividend 14.4 pence.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shell Transport and Trading Plc said on Thursday its interim dividend would be 14.4 pence per share, an 11.6 percent increase over the 1995 interim of 12.9p.  </p>
<p>Royal Dutch Petroleum, the Dutch arm of the Royal Dutch/Shell group, announced separately in the Netherlands an interim dividend of 4.30 guilders, up from 3.90 a year ago. Analysts said the market range of expectations for the dividends was 14.0 to 15.5 pence for Shell and 4.00 to 4.50 guilders for Royal Dutch.</p>
<p>Shell shares will go ex-dividend on September 23. The pay date is November 4 and record date is October 1.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
